This metapackage selects piano-snap-graphics and its piano-mesa-2404
content provider. The provider uses the core24 ABI and includes Adreno 830
revision 1 support. It does not replace native desktop Mesa or snapd.

Source and build instructions:
https://github.com/yzddmr6/xiaomipad-8pro-mainline/blob/main/docs/BUILD.en.md#graphics-for-core24-snaps

Install both debs together with apt. Close GPU snap applications before
running sudo piano-snap-graphics-connect --install on an installed system.
The provider's service handles initial seeding on the next boot.

Removing this metapackage does not disconnect content or remove the provider.
Restore each previous content connection and discard its saved namespace
with snap-discard-ns before removing the provider snap and its deb package.
